(1. NETWORK PRINCIPLES) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Cashless service is a payment arrangement, not a separate coverage guarantee.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-1.1  Network status) Tj
T*
(   A hospital is network only when contracted and active for the date of admission.) Tj
T*
(   Directory information must be verified at request time.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-1.2  Member choice) Tj
T*
(   Members may use non-network providers subject to reimbursement terms, emergency rules and) Tj
T*
(   any schedule restrictions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-1.3  No balance-billing promise) Tj
T*
(   The member remains responsible for non-covered items, co-payment, deductible, excess over) Tj
T*
(   limits and provider charges not accepted under the network tariff.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
