36 756 Td
(2. PLANNED ADMISSION WORKFLOW) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Planned treatment should be assessed before admission.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-2.1  Submission timing) Tj
T*
(   The hospital should submit a complete preauthorization request at least forty-eight hours) Tj
T*
(   before planned admission.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-2.2  Clinical content) Tj
T*
(   The request must identify member, diagnosis, symptoms, investigations, proposed) Tj
T*
(   procedure, estimated charges, room class and expected stay.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-2.3  Possible outcomes) Tj
T*
(   The request may be authorized, partially authorized, queried, declined for cashless) Tj
T*
(   service, or referred for medical review. Declined cashless service is not automatically a) Tj
T*
(   final claim rejection.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-2.4  Change in treatment) Tj
T*
(   Material change in diagnosis, procedure, implant, room or estimate requires enhancement) Tj
T*
(   or revised authorization.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
