36 756 Td
(3. EMERGENCY ADMISSION WORKFLOW) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Emergency care must not be delayed solely for administrative authorization.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-3.1  Notification) Tj
T*
(   Hospital or member should notify the TPA within twenty-four hours or as soon as) Tj
T*
(   practicable.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-3.2  Stabilization) Tj
T*
(   Necessary stabilization proceeds according to clinical judgement. Authorization may be) Tj
T*
(   retrospective when immediate records were unavailable.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-3.3  Emergency evidence) Tj
T*
(   Emergency notes should describe onset, vital findings, provisional diagnosis, immediate) Tj
T*
(   treatment and reason admission could not await planned authorization.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
