(4. AUTHORIZATION CONTROLS) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Authorization must be traceable and limited to evidence reviewed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-4.1  Authorization identifier) Tj
T*
(   Every decision receives a unique identifier, timestamp, reviewer and versioned evidence) Tj
T*
(   list.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-4.2  Scope) Tj
T*
(   Authorization identifies approved diagnosis or procedure, room eligibility, estimated) Tj
T*
(   amount, conditions and exclusions reserved for final assessment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-4.3  Enhancement) Tj
T*
(   An enhancement request states the additional amount and clinical reason. Earlier approval) Tj
T*
(   is not erased when an enhancement is declined.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-4.4  Validity) Tj
T*
(   Authorization is valid only for the named member, provider, admission episode and) Tj
T*
(   validity period.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
