(5. DISCHARGE AND FINAL SETTLEMENT) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(The hospital submits final evidence before discharge settlement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-5.1  Final packet) Tj
T*
(   Final bill, breakup, discharge summary, procedure notes, pharmacy and diagnostic details,) Tj
T*
(   implant evidence and member acknowledgment are required as applicable.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-5.2  Reconciliation) Tj
T*
(   Compare estimated and final diagnosis, procedure, stay, room and cost. Explain every) Tj
T*
(   material variance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-5.3  Member collection) Tj
T*
(   The provider may collect documented non-payable amounts. Undifferentiated deposits or) Tj
T*
(   unexplained deductions must be escalated.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-5.4  Post-settlement audit) Tj
T*
(   Payment may be audited, but recovery requires evidence, authority and due process.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
