(6. NON-NETWORK AND REIMBURSEMENT CONVERSION) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Cashless unavailability must not be presented as proof that treatment is excluded.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-6.1  Conversion) Tj
T*
(   A member may submit reimbursement documents when cashless service is unavailable or) Tj
T*
(   declined, subject to policy terms.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-6.2  Emergency non-network care) Tj
T*
(   Emergency non-network hospitalization is assessed on necessity and reasonable charges;) Tj
T*
(   failure to reach a network hospital must be documented where relevant.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-6.3  Provider not recognized) Tj
T*
(   Claims from an unlicensed, excluded or unverifiable provider require compliance review) Tj
T*
(   and may be inadmissible under EXC-6.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
