36 756 Td
(7. COMMUNICATION TEMPLATES) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Communications must separate administrative status from final coverage.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-7.1  Query language) Tj
T*
(   State the exact information required, its purpose and the response channel. Avoid) Tj
T*
(   language implying rejection before review.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-7.2  Partial authorization) Tj
T*
(   Identify approved amount, reserved items, member cost share and possibility of final) Tj
T*
(   adjustment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-7.3  Cashless decline) Tj
T*
(   Explain whether the issue is provider arrangement, insufficient evidence, policy) Tj
T*
(   exclusion or non-eligibility, and state whether reimbursement remains available.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
