(8. SERVICE MONITORING) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Operational metrics must not reward unsafe automatic approval or denial.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-8.1  Metrics) Tj
T*
(   Monitor response time, query rate, avoidable resubmission, member complaints, overturned) Tj
T*
(   decisions, leakage and provider variance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-8.2  Quality sampling) Tj
T*
(   Sample authorized, declined and enhanced cases for clause accuracy, clinical rationale) Tj
T*
(   and communication quality.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NET-8.3  System fallback) Tj
T*
(   During outage, record requests through approved continuity channels and preserve original) Tj
T*
(   receipt time.) Tj
T*
ET
